        "reason": "Portable WGSL floating-point semantics do not guarantee preservation of the subnormal values required by this fixture. Backend evidence: Metal flushes denormals to zero in the ALU; RoiAlign interpolation/pooling arithmetic flushes the subnormal pixel on GPU. Permanent FTZ limitation."
